. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SOfOqbwqv28Q7kNvwGHmzCD&_nc_oc=Adqe2MKKj3UXrZ7RP9DBchKKQQ6qRMdp8lH3Imbq1Y9rpMSSWu_Cnw2DhhkxXFxCBj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7fdJ1T-DvIit3jueGU1N4M1hZse1XZ6B_dEBHC8uMFqA&oe=6A0F023E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oQymxQqBGNMQ7kNvwG5J8YV&_nc_oc=AdojuUFvdzUK6hurWsTv-6SNdzI6xj_BcWGZdJXCR4rD7AqroV6e5LP9f9OnhPeHSvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6yWU4kmiN_-bV7Xi6913P8bsmB09vHjHEsXyZ218NjZQ&oe=6A0F18DE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aJXFb4xZb70Q7kNvwHFnFGF&_nc_oc=AdoIuG9fGnXp_Wx4CwWvC0haJkxORNcNtgKHDBLRB2sgA1NL8XP0NtTVgBWXGsNhg98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af78j9tdFmeHeceG1NHwVid0OYCvJWgcINngNgs4RVrr_Q&oe=6A0F0E5B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco